cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use TinyPDG in academic work, please cite the conference paper
  under preferred-citation.
title: TinyPDG
abstract: >-
  A library for building intraprocedural program dependence graphs for
  Java programs, with command line tools for writing graphs in dot
  format, detecting code clones, and collecting dependence frequencies.
type: software
authors:
